    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Are You Satisfied With Your Current Situation? </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Are You Feeling the Pressure From Life? </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Are You Trapped By Life?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A girl accidentally came to a world full of different caves, and she and a smiley face cube were looking for a way out. You will control this little girl to pass the levels and reach new caves one after another.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The appearance of the cave is determined by the girl's cognition and memory. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >[Key Features]</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore caves, solving puzzles and find the exit.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Having conversations with your smiley face cube fellow in each cave/level.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >16 levels in total</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >4 different caves, 4 different topics(school, family, workplace, marriage).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3181830/extras/00eb23a945a4a81a554ba50dce0ca353.avif?t=1752933655\" width=616 height=160 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >[tips]</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Keep an eye on the shiny areas in each cave/level.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In order to make the exit/portal appear, the completion degree has to reach 80%, which mean you have to dig at least 80% of the soils in each cave.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You may have to grab the keys to unlock the locks in the cave first.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You may face spiders and other dangerous items, be careful!!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Be aware that some of the content may be a little scary.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3181830/extras/e17d0d980924382e5c486e39e1940151.avif?t=1752933655\" width=616 height=160 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >[Special thanks]</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Russian localization: prosto_ratchet</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Special thanks to prosto_ratchet for testing the game and helping me find bugs!</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Are You Satisfied With Your Current Situation? </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Are You Feeling the Pressure From Life? </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Are You Trapped By Life?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A girl accidentally came to a world full of different caves, and she and a smiley face cube were looking for a way out. You will control this little girl to pass the levels and reach new caves one after another.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The appearance of the cave is determined by the girl's cognition and memory. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >[Key Features]</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore caves, solving puzzles and find the exit.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Having conversations with your smiley face cube fellow in each cave/level.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >16 levels in total</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >4 different caves, 4 different topics(school, family, workplace, marriage).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3181830/extras/00eb23a945a4a81a554ba50dce0ca353.avif?t=1752933655\" width=616 height=160 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >[tips]</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Keep an eye on the shiny areas in each cave/level.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In order to make the exit/portal appear, the completion degree has to reach 80%, which mean you have to dig at least 80% of the soils in each cave.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You may have to grab the keys to unlock the locks in the cave first.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You may face spiders and other dangerous items, be careful!!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Be aware that some of the content may be a little scary.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3181830/extras/e17d0d980924382e5c486e39e1940151.avif?t=1752933655\" width=616 height=160 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >[Special thanks]</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Russian localization: prosto_ratchet</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Special thanks to prosto_ratchet for testing the game and helping me find bugs!</p>",
